   –   all references to “RTE” refer to Réseau de Transport d’Électricité, a regulated subsidiary of EDF managed
       independently within the meaning of the French Code de l’énergie and accounted for using the equity
       method;

   –   all references to “Standard & Poor’s” refer to S&P Global Ratings Europe Limited;

   –   all references to the “U.S.” and “United States” are to the United States of America;

   –   all references to the “UK” are to the United Kingdom;

   –   all references to “€” and “euro” are to the lawful currency of the European Monetary Union;

   –   all references to “U.S. dollar,” “U.S.$” or “$” are to the lawful currency of the United States of America;
       and

   –   all references to “£,” “sterling” and “pence” are to the lawful currency of the United Kingdom.




